1
00:00:00,060 --> 00:00:01,756
In this town, everybody husses.

2
00:00:01,726 --> 00:00:03,521
Grandma opens a jar. HUSS!

3
00:00:03,471 --> 00:00:05,503
The mailman lifts a box. HUSS!

4
00:00:05,453 --> 00:00:07,365
Even the cat stretches. HUSS!

5
00:00:07,465 --> 00:00:08,291
Except me.

6
00:00:08,491 --> 00:00:10,819
When I try to huss, I just... squeak.

7
00:00:11,019 --> 00:00:14,026
Every summer, our town plays tug of war against Mudville.

8
00:00:13,976 --> 00:00:17,201
And every summer, we lose. Face first. Into the mud.

9
00:00:17,351 --> 00:00:19,618
This year, our captain was one player short.

10
00:00:19,568 --> 00:00:21,769
You're in, Leo. Just... don't squeak.

11
00:00:21,919 --> 00:00:23,363
So I tried everything.

12
00:00:23,313 --> 00:00:26,665
Grandpa's mega spicy chili. Smoke came out of my ears. Squeak.

13
00:00:26,715 --> 00:00:29,878
A huss tutorial. Even the laptop hussed louder than me.

14
00:00:30,078 --> 00:00:35,005
So every night, while the town slept, I trained. No huss. Just me and a rope.

15
00:00:35,055 --> 00:00:36,948
Night one, I pulled Grandma's car.

16
00:00:36,898 --> 00:00:40,242
Night seven, the ice cream truck. With the driver still asleep inside.

17
00:00:40,492 --> 00:00:41,993
Then came the big pull.

18
00:00:41,993 --> 00:00:45,027
Mudville hussed so hard, the trees lost their leaves.

19
00:00:44,977 --> 00:00:46,603
HUSS! HUSS! HUSS!

20
00:00:46,653 --> 00:00:49,615
Ten seconds left. Our shoes were sliding toward the mud.

21
00:00:49,615 --> 00:00:51,585
I grabbed the rope. I opened my mouth...

22
00:00:51,685 --> 00:00:52,273
Squeak.

23
00:00:52,373 --> 00:00:55,077
Mudville laughed so hard, they almost let go.

24
00:00:55,177 --> 00:00:58,422
Five seconds. Seven nights of pulling, all saved up.

25
00:00:58,422 --> 00:01:00,269
And then... it came out.

26
00:01:00,319 --> 00:01:01,192
HUSS!

27
00:01:01,242 --> 00:01:06,502
The rope snapped tight. All of Mudville flew over our heads, did a full loop, and landed face first in their own mud.

28
00:01:06,552 --> 00:01:07,529
We won!

29
00:01:07,779 --> 00:01:10,242
Now everybody in this town husses. Even me.

30
00:01:10,292 --> 00:01:12,030
HUSS! HUSS! HUSS!

